# Never let local state into an image. Without this, `COPY backend/ ./` bakes
# backend/.env — SECRET_KEY, dev RPC and a stale factory address — into the
# published artifact, and python-dotenv then fills any variable compose did
# not set, so a development contract address silently wins in production.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
contracts/artifacts
contracts/cache
contracts/deployments
frontend/.env.local
deploy/.env
tests/fixtures
test_reports
Dockerfile.verify-*
.ccr-ca.crt
